---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---
<PageLayout title="About | VoidStack" description="About VoidStack and the person behind it.">
  <div class="about-card">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>
      I'm a software engineer interested in backend development, distributed systems, cloud
      infrastructure, and emerging technologies.
    </p>
    <p>
      VoidStack is my personal space to document what I learn, experiment with new technologies,
      and build projects that strengthen my engineering fundamentals.
    </p>
    <p>
      The goal is simple: stop using abstractions blindly and understand what happens beneath
      them.
    </p>
    <div class="about-stats">
      <div><strong>01</strong><span>CURIOSITY</span></div>
      <div><strong>02</strong><span>CONSISTENCY</span></div>
      <div><strong>03</strong><span>DEEP WORK</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
